      "title": "SERVER AVAILABILITY",
      "description": "Inventory: heartbeat seen within 30 days. Online: heartbeat received within 5 minutes. No heartbeat: inventory server with no heartbeat within 5 minutes.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 18,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 5
